      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know those exist but they're just band-aids on a bullet wound. it feels so pointless to keep fighting for a life that's basically already ruined. it's like i'm just dragging this weight around for no reason. everything is just heavy and dark and i'm so tired of trying to find a way to survive when there's nothing left to survive for. it's just a loop of misery.",
